cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use any TRI-27 ISA discoveries, please cite our defensive publication."
title: "TRI-27: Ternary ISA with Coptic Encoding"
abstract: "This bundle presents Trinity's TRI-27 ternary instruction set architecture, featuring 36 opcodes for balanced ternary computation, 27 registers organized in 3 banks (alpha-eta: baseline, iota-rho: workspace, sigma-sampi: sacred), Coptic alphabet encoding for human-readable ternary (3 trits per Coptic letter), cross-bank validation preventing invalid state transitions, T27 binary episode format for experience replay, and neuro-inspired wrapper interfaces (Reticular Raphe for phi-decay rolling, Phoenix Medulla for resilience, Queen vmPFC for prefrontal orchestration). All innovations published as defensive prior art with Zenodo DOIs."
